# List — Layout B: compact row cards

Narrow placement (3-4 cols). No column grid: title line + one meta
line per row. Survives squeezing where a table can't.

```
+--------------------------+
| Open deals (132)         |
+--------------------------+
| Acme Corp                |
|   open . $40k . anna     |
| .......................  |
| Globex                   |
|   nego . $25k . jens     |
| .......................  |
| Hooli                    |
|   open . $18k . mia      |
| .......................  |
| Initech                  |
|   open . $12k . anna     |
+--------------------------+
| + 128 more               |
+--------------------------+
```

Config: same schema; columns[0] = title, columns[1..3] = meta line.
Auto-selected when w < 5.
